# Dos and Don'ts

- DO NOT remove past failure patterns (even if they appear resolved). The same failure can reappear in the future.
- DO NOT delete or rewrite existing attempts. If a failure pattern already exists, add the new attempt under it; otherwise, create a new pattern section.
- DO NOT delete timeline entries. Either append a new timeline bullet for the new attempt, or, if an existing timeline bullet for that attempt already exists, augment it by adding the new attempt number.
- DO always incorporate the latest attempt into the summary, even if it just means adding a new attempt number citation.
- If in doubt, prefer appending while keeping all previous content intact.